text.section:
The unexpended balances of the following special funds shall not be diverted or expended for any purpose other than each fund's intended purpose. The special funds are:

Apple Fund (§ 3.2-1206);


Peanut Fund (§ 3.2-1906);


Plant Pollination Fund (§ 3.2-2806);


Virginia Agricultural Foundation Fund (§ 3.2-2905);


Virginia Bright Flue-Cured Tobacco Promotion Fund (§ 3.2-2407);


Virginia Cattle Industry Fund (§ 3.2-1305);


Virginia Corn Fund (§ 3.2-1411);


Virginia Cotton Fund (§ 3.2-1511);


Virginia Dark-Fired Tobacco Promotion Fund (§ 3.2-2407.1);


Virginia Egg Fund (§ 3.2-1605);


Virginia Horse Industry Promotion and Development Fund (§ 3.2-1704);


Virginia Marine Products Fund (§ 3.2-2705);


Virginia Milk Commission Assessments Fund (§ 3.2-3220);


Virginia Potato Fund (§ 3.2-1810);


Virginia Sheep Industry Promotion and Development Fund (§ 3.2-2111);


Virginia Small Grains Fund (§ 3.2-2211);


Virginia Soybean Fund (§ 3.2-2311); and


Virginia Wine Promotion Fund (§ 3.2-3005).
